  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1
Indicator 1.1: Number of written mandate, organisational structure and SOPs. 
Indicator 1.2: Number of established coordination mechanism among criminal justice actors. 

Output 2
Indicator 2.1: Number of trained police and judicial police officers on human rights principles. 
Indicator 2.2.: Number of case management system.

Output 3
Indicator 3.1: Number of data collection and analysis unit under the Integration Committee established at MOI for mapping armed groups.
Indicator 3.2: Number of officers trained on data collection and analysis, and mapping.

Output 4
Indicator 4.1: Number of manuals for procurement, set management, HR and finance developed.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2017">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output1
Baseline 1.1: Absence of written mandate, organisational structure and SOPs.
Baseline 1.2: Absence of coordination mechanism among criminal justice actors.

Output 2
Baseline 2.1: Lack of trained police and judicial police officers on human rights principles. 
Baseline 2.2: Lack of accuracy of case management system and record management. 

Output 3
Baseline 3.1: Integration and Re-integration Committee at MOI established. 
Baseline 3.2: No officers under the Committee trained on data collection and analysis/mapping. 

Output 4: 
Baseline 4.1: Ineffective administrative systems exist.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Provide support to Ministry of Interior 
2.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. UNDP supported the Ministry of Interior in developing a concept note for establishing the community policing unit inside Tripoli directorate. 15 police officers improved police personnel skills in community policing. This included a study tour to Amman, resulted in improved skills of police officers, half of them women, and set the foundation for more community focused work in the new project to be starting in January 2023. 

UNDP in collaboration with UNSMIL provided technical advisory support to a Joint Programme Technical Committee. The committee, which is composed of representatives from UNDP, UNSMIL and the national counterparts (Ministry of Interior and Ministry of Justice) is functional and responsible for the identification of various capacity building and reform initiatives for criminal justice institutions.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP continued to provide technical advisory support to Ministry of Interior and Ministry of Justice through an established coordination mechanism to further capacity development efforts for rule of law institutions.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP trained 35 rule of law officials police, judges, prosecutors, civil society organizations to strengthen responding capacity to investigate Sexual and Gender based Violence (SGBV) and particularly violence against women and increase women access to justice. The training resulted in increase of evel of knowledge, awareness and gender sensitivity was increased.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued capacity building of police corps</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP trained police corps including women and completed Training of Trainers</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
